pkexec
# grub-common was already present (pulled in indirectly) but not the
# actual grub-install binary - Calamares' bootloader step needs it.
# grub-pc and grub-efi-amd64 CONFLICT (Debian packaging, can't install
# both) - BIOS only for now. Supporting EFI-mode target installs is
# issue #7's actual scope (may need a hook that picks the right variant
# based on how the system booted, not just installing both).
grub-pc
